    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Shefatia mutabane wa Mattani, ni Gedalia mutabane wa Pashuhuri, ni Yehukali mutabane wa Shelemia, ni Pashuhuri mutabane wa Malakia, baawulira nga nkobera abantu nti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musengwa Katonda akoba ati, ‘Omuntu yeenayeena anaasigala mu kibuga kino aidha kwitirwa mu lutalo, oba okufa endhala, oba okufa endwaire ya kawumpuli. Aye anaakifuluma ni yeeghaayo eri Abababilonia, aidha kuwoniagho obulamu bwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era naakobera abantu nti Musengwa Katonda akoba ati, ‘Bwenebwene nze Musengwa Katonda nja kughaayo ekibuga kino eri Abababilonia bakigeme.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakungu baaja ye kyabazinga, baamukoba bati: “Omusaadha ono bamwite bwite, kuba ensambo y'ali kwogeramu emala mu baisirukale amaani abali mu kibuga kino, era n'abantu abandi abakaasigaire mu kibuga kino. Tali kukolerera bulungi bwa bantu bano, aye ali kubaitaitana bwitaitane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Zedekia yairamu ati: “Wuuyo ali mu ngalo dhaimwe, nze tiidha kubalobera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale bangema bantwala, bandhisa n'emigugha mu nsulo eyali mu luya olw'ekisaagaati kya kyabazinga, nga mwene yo n'omulangira Malakia. Ensulo eyo tiyaliimu maadhi, aye yalimu bwa bitosi. Era naadimira mu bitosi omwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Ebedimeleki Omwethiopia omulaawe, eyagheerezanga mu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, yaawulira nga bantaire mu nsulo. Mu kiseera ekyo, kyabazinga yali atyaime ku gwetebwa Omulyango gwa Benjamini ng'ali mu lwekobaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Ebedimeleki oyo yaaja y'ali, yaamukoba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, abantu bano bakoze bubi inho. Bataire Yeremia mu nsulo mw'aidha okufiira endhala, kuba mu kibuga timukaali mere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga yaalagira Ebedimeleki afuneyo abasaadha basatu, baidhe bantooleyo mu nsulo nga nkaali kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedimeleki yaaja n'abasaadha abo mu iterekero ery'omu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, yaatoolayo ebigoye ebikaire ebikanufukanufu, yaabinsuulira mu nsulo ng'akozesa emigugha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yankoba ati: “Toola ebigoye ebyo obizingirire mu nkwagha dho, emigugha girobe kukusala.” Zeena naakola ntyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bampaluza bantoolayo mu nsulo. Era baamala bankuumira mu luya olw'ekisaagaati kya kyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kabiri kyabazinga Zedekia yandhetesa bantwale ye yali ku mulyango ogwokusatu ogw'eisinzizo. Bwe natuukayo yankoba ati: “Nja kukubuuza ekibuuzo, era nhenda onkobere amazima geene nga tolekaayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamwiramu nti: “Isebantu kyabazinga, bwe nnaakukobera amazima oidha kundhita bwite. Era ni bwenaakugha amagezi toidha kumpulirisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Zedekia oyo yandayirira mu kaama ati: “Nga Musengwa Katonda bw'ali omulamu, Katonda oyo eyatugha obulamu, tiidha kukwita waire okukughaayo y'abo abenda okukwita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naamukobera nti: “Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli, akoba ati, ‘Bwoneeghaayo eri abakungu ba kyabazinga w'e Babilonia, tibaja kukwita, n'ekibuga kino tibaja kukyokya muliro. Baja kukuleka iwe n'ab'omu maka go musigale nga mukaali balamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bw'onaaloba okweghaayo eri abakungu ba kyabazinga w'e Babilonia, Musengwa Katonda aja kughaayo ekibuga kino eri Abababilonia bakyokye omuliro, era n'iwe weena olobe kubawona.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kyabazinga yairamu ati: “Nze ntya Bayudaaya banaife abaamala okweghaayo ni baira ku luuyi lw'Abababilonia. Abababilonia basobola okumpaayo eri Abayudaaya abo bandeetera okulumizibwa nga bandaazadaaza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze naamukoba nti: “Abababilonia tibaidha kukuwaayo eri Bayudaaya abo. Nkweghembye gondera obukwenda bwa Musengwa Katonda bwe ndi kukukobera, olwo byonabyona biidha kukujiira bukalamu era baidha kukuleka osigale ng'okaali mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bw'onaaloba okweghaayo, bino n'ebija okukutuukaku Musengwa Katonda bye yandholeka mu kubonekerwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kubonekerwa okwo nabona abakazi boonaboona abaali basigaire mu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, ng'abaisirukale bali kubatwalira abakungu ba kyabazinga w'e Babilonia. Era nga bali kuja bwe bakoba bati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
