              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakungu boonaboona baidha bambuuza, era zeena naabakobera byenebyene kyabazinga bye yankoba okubakoba. Kale bandeka, ghazira muntu yawuliraku bye twayogera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.27",
